# Batcotrans Logistics Pvt Ltd — the white-label brand for the web app.
#
#   Docker:        docker run --env-file brands/batco.env -e AGENT_URL=http://agent:3001 -p 8080:80 rafai-web
#   Dev / static:  cp brands/batco.env .env.local && npm run dev        (or: npm run build)
#
# The images are files in brands/batco/, named below by their path on the site.
# A build, or the container at start, copies in only the files named here, so
# this customer's site serves its own logo and no one else's. source.png is the
# artwork as supplied; logo.png is it trimmed to 144 px tall at most, twice the
# sidebar's 72 px; icon.png is the tab icon. All are transparent.
#
# Colours are taken from the logo. Its red (#c02322) is 5.7:1 against the page,
# so it is the accent as it is; on the dark theme it is 2.9:1, so the accent
# there is a lighter red (#e15453). The bar across the top is the logo's own
# red, and the sidebar is left neutral. The lettering is black, which the dark
# sidebar would swallow, so logo-dark.png is the same logo with it lightened.
# The icon is the emblem.
#
# The assistant's OWN name — what it answers when asked who it is — is set on the
# agent service, as tenant "batco" in rafai-ai-agent/src/db/tenants.json.

BRAND_NAME=Batcotrans AI
BRAND_COMPANY=Batcotrans Logistics Pvt Ltd
BRAND_TAGLINE=Analytics
BRAND_ACCENT=c02322
BRAND_ACCENT_DARK=e15453
BRAND_BAR=c02322
BRAND_LOGO_URL=/brands/batco/logo.png
BRAND_LOGO_DARK_URL=/brands/batco/logo-dark.png
BRAND_FAVICON_URL=/brands/batco/icon.png
